### Snowflake Developers
- **Responsibilities**: Design and implement data warehouse solutions; write and optimize SQL queries and stored procedures; manage data migrations; configure virtual warehouses, data sharing, and zero-copy cloning; implement security measures (encryption, RBAC, data masking); create and manage data pipelines
